 ],
 "machine_rule": "B35: \"signals\" are cue patterns (regex, case-insensitive, German+English) that SUGGEST an operation from an objective text; declared operations always win and are merged, never replaced. \"requires\" lists didactic components per operation; \"validators\" names engine checks that must have run; \"claim_types\" are the evidence types the pack produces. A requirement \"a|b\" is met by either component (no single mandatory block form)."
}